{
  "id": "aws-dynamodb-table",
  "title": "建立 DynamoDB 資料表並讀寫資料",
  "description": "建立一個用顧客編號和訂單編號當主鍵的資料表，寫入訂單、用 Query 查詢某位顧客的訂單，再啟用 TTL 並刪除資料。",
  "provider": "aws",
  "estimatedMinutes": 15,
  "initialState": {
    "files": {},
    "cloud": {}
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "instruction": "建立資料表 Orders：分割區索引鍵是 CustomerId（字串），排序索引鍵是 OrderId（字串），使用隨需容量模式（PAY_PER_REQUEST）。",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb create-table --table-name Orders --attribute-definitions AttributeName=CustomerId,AttributeType=S AttributeName=OrderId,AttributeType=S --key-schema AttributeName=CustomerId,KeyType=HASH AttributeName=OrderId,KeyType=RANGE --billing-mode PAY_PER_REQUEST",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "definition"
        ],
        "equals": {
          "partitionKey": "CustomerId",
          "sortKey": "OrderId",
          "billingMode": "PAY_PER_REQUEST"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "寫入第一筆訂單：CustomerId 是 c001、OrderId 是 o001、Total 是數字 350。每個值都要標明型別。",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb put-item --table-name Orders --item '{\"CustomerId\": {\"S\": \"c001\"}, \"OrderId\": {\"S\": \"o001\"}, \"Total\": {\"N\": \"350\"}}'",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "items",
          "c001|o001"
        ],
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "再寫入兩筆：c001 的 o002，以及 c002 的 o001。其他屬性可以隨意加，每筆都可以不一樣。",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb put-item --table-name Orders --item '{\"CustomerId\": {\"S\": \"c001\"}, \"OrderId\": {\"S\": \"o002\"}, \"Total\": {\"N\": \"120\"}}'，再把 CustomerId 換成 c002、OrderId 換成 o001 寫一次",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "itemCount"
        ],
        "equals": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "用 Query 查出顧客 c001 的所有訂單，看看回傳了幾筆。（試試看用 Total 當 key condition 會發生什麼事。）",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb query --table-name Orders --key-condition-expression \"CustomerId = :c\" --expression-attribute-values '{\":c\": {\"S\": \"c001\"}}'",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "queriedPartitions",
          "c001"
        ],
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "啟用 TTL，用 ExpiresAt 屬性存放到期時間，讓過期的訂單自動刪除。",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb update-time-to-live --table-name Orders --time-to-live-specification Enabled=true,AttributeName=ExpiresAt",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "ttlAttribute"
        ],
        "equals": "ExpiresAt"
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "顧客 c002 取消了訂單 o001，用主鍵刪除這個項目。",
      "hint": "aws dynamodb delete-item --table-name Orders --key '{\"CustomerId\": {\"S\": \"c002\"}, \"OrderId\": {\"S\": \"o001\"}}'",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "aws",
          "dynamodb",
          "tables",
          "Orders",
          "items",
          "c002|o001"
        ],
        "exists": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
